     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»pilot 4.0« – intuitive and intelligent",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»pilot 4.0« has established itself as a powerful and comprehensive software solution for all ZOLLER setting, measuring, and testing devices. The intuitive, graphic user guidance guides users quickly and reliably to precise measurement results. Thanks to »pilot 4.0«, even complex measuring tasks can be completed successfully on the first try. At the same time, the software offers such a wide range of functionality that there is a solution for every requirement. It is no coincidence that »pilot« applies as the world’s unrivaled standard for measuring, inspecting, and managing cutting tools.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/8/csm_software_pilot4_de_5a2fec4fe1.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1339,
            "h": 846
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1958",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tool Analysis Made Easy",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Equipped with a swivelling incident light camera, the ZOLLER »smileCheck« and »smartCheck« series of devices are ideal for tool inspection. Tool parameters, geometric data, and cutting-edge contours are entered both radially and axially, enabling tool analyses to be performed universally, quickly, and simply.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/f/csm_software_Werkzeuganalyse_de_f781897761.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1339,
            "h": 846
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1956",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tool Contours Inspection in Detail",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Developed with and for tool manufacturers, ZOLLER software offers solutions that meet the highest standards. Even complex measurement and inspection tasks are ingeniously simple in their application.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/e/csm_software_Werkzeugkonturen_de_75414bda61.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1339,
            "h": 846
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1965",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Perfect even in specialized fields",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Precision across the board – »pilot 4.0« offers innovative solutions even for specialized applications and is continuously refined in-house by ZOLLER, which has extensive development capabilities, to meet the requirements of new tooling technologies, expertly implement customer requirements, and simultaneously make existing processes even simpler and more efficient. Take, for example, the critical task of preparing grinding wheels for new orders. ZOLLER offers a consistently perfect solution for short setup and lead times: from management, warehousing, and assembly all the way to measurement and the transmission of measurement data to your grinding machine.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/d/csm_software_Spezialgebiete_de_661d66495b.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1339,
            "h": 846
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1967",
          "bg": "",
